1
00:00:15,576 --> 00:00:20,132
On doit conduire jusqu'au parking, Marinette.
We have to drive to the parking lot, Marinette.

2
00:00:20,232 --> 00:00:25,124
Oui, mais il y a un embouteillage sur l'autoroute.
Yes, but there's a traffic jam on the highway.

3
00:00:25,224 --> 00:00:28,532
Le camion devant nous ralentit.
The truck in front of us is slowing down.

4
00:00:28,632 --> 00:00:33,956
La moto derrière nous va vite. Attention !
The motorcycle behind us is going fast. Watch out!

5
00:00:34,056 --> 00:00:37,196
Je vais freiner au feu rouge.
I'm going to brake at the red light.

6
00:00:37,296 --> 00:00:42,308
Merci. On peut traverser la rue ici ?
Thanks. Can we cross the street here?

7
00:00:42,408 --> 00:00:47,732
Oui, quand le feu est vert. Regarde bien.
Yes, when the light is green. Look carefully.

8
00:00:47,832 --> 00:00:51,932
D'accord, puis on se gare au parking.
Okay, then we'll park in the parking lot.
